es the franchise's core adventure formula."},{"source":"work_aw35","target":"work_aw20","type":"work_work","relation_type":"influenced","relation_note":"While a more dramatic and biographical film, its narrative of a perilous, all-consuming search for a mythical lost city in the Amazon jungle shares a foundational premise with Crystal Skull's third act."},{"source":"work_aw35","target":"work_aw321","type":"work_work","relation_type":"influenced","relation_note":"The season's subplot involving a secret Russian lab in the American desert conducting psychic experiments during the Cold War thematically echoes the film's opening at Hangar 51 and the psychic powers of Irina Spalko."},{"source":"work_aw35","target":"work_aw98","type":"work_work","relation_type":"inspired_by","relation_note":"The character of Mutt Williams, with his leather jacket, motorcycle, and greaser attitude, is a direct visual and character homage to Marlon Brando's iconic portrayal of Johnny Strabler."},{"source":"work_aw35","target":"work_aw99","type":"work_work","relation_type":"inspired_by","relation_note":"The film's atmosphere of Cold War tension, pitting military force against scientific inquiry in the face of an otherworldly discovery, echoes the narrative structure of this Howard Hawks-produced classic."},{"source":"work_aw35","target":"work_aw16","type":"work_work","relation_type":"inspired_by","relation_note":"As the fourth film in the series, it directly continues the story and character established in the original trilogy, particularly 'Raiders'."},{"source":"work_aw35","target":"work_aw17","type":"work_work","relation_type":"inspired_by","relation_note":"The film's shift to a 1950s setting incorporates thematic and visual elements from classic sci-fi of that era, including alien visitors and Cold War anxieties, mirroring the tone of films like this one."},{"source":"work_aw35","target":"work_aw60","type":"work_work","relation_type":"inspired_by","relation_note":"George Lucas and Steven 